<title>USA: Florida to sell $9.53 mln revenue bonds Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Florida to sell $9.53 mln revenue bonds Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TALLAHASSEE, Fla 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida will sell $9.53 million of Floria Facilities Pool revenue bonds by competitive bid on Wednesday at 1130 EST, the state Division of Bond Finance said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The issue is designated Florida Department of Management Services Division of Facilities Management Facilities Pool Revenue Bonds, Series 1996 B.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
</text>
